@startuml
actor Teacher
actor Student
participant "React Web App" as Web
participant "Express API / Socket.IO Gateway" as Server
participant "Session Service" as Service
participant "SQLite Repository" as Repo
participant "Socket.IO Session Room" as Room
Teacher -> Web: Open / and choose role route
Student -> Web: Open / and choose role route
Web --> Teacher: Render shared layout / route placeholder
Web --> Student: Render shared layout / route placeholder
Student -> Web: Resolve activity code before joining
Web -> Server: GET /api/v1/sessions/by-code/{activityCode} (anonymous, rate limited)
Server -> Service: Validate/normalize code and resolve minimal summary
Service -> Repo: Read public activity summary
Repo --> Service: sessionId, phase
Server --> Web: Summary or 429 RATE_LIMITED
Student -> Web: Query state, current-target and results before any Round exists
Web -> Server: GET state/current-target/results (verified ActorContext)
Server -> Service: Read Session with no current Round
Service --> Server: Waiting snapshot; null target; empty results
Server --> Web: state Waiting/null; current-target {data:null}; results {data:[]}
Teacher -> Web: Choose next target
Web -> Server: Teacher command (verified ActorContext)
Server -> Service: select next target
Service -> Repo: Transaction: create Round(Waiting), set currentRound, increment version
Repo --> Service: committed snapshot
Service --> Server: Waiting snapshot
Server -> Room: Emit session:state:changed
Room --> Web: Notify connected teacher/student clients
Teacher -> Web: Preview target in Waiting
Web -> Server: GET current-target (verified Teacher ActorContext)
Server -> Service: Authorize teacher preview; read target
Service -> Repo: Read Question/QuestionGroup and Blanks
Repo --> Service: CurrentTargetView
Server --> Web: CurrentTargetView
Student -> Web: Request current-target in Waiting
Web -> Server: GET current-target (verified Participant ActorContext)
Server --> Web: 403 FORBIDDEN; no question content
Teacher -> Web: Start current Round
Web -> Server: Teacher start command
Server -> Service: start existing Round
Service -> Repo: Transaction: Waiting -> Active, increment version
Repo --> Service: committed snapshot
Server -> Room: Emit session:state:changed
Room --> Web: Notify connected clients of Active
Student -> Web: Request current-target in Active
Web -> Server: GET current-target (verified Participant ActorContext)
Server -> Service: Authorize Active Participant; read target
Service -> Repo: Read Question/QuestionGroup and Blanks
Repo --> Service: CurrentTargetView
Server --> Web: CurrentTargetView
Teacher -> Web: End current Round
Web -> Server: Teacher end command
Server -> Service: end current Round (winner supplied by owning Feature, if any)
Service -> Repo: Transaction: Active -> Ended; persist/replace Result if owner supplies winner
Repo --> Service: committed Ended snapshot and current Result (or no result)
Server -> Room: Emit session:state:changed
Room --> Web: Notify connected clients of Ended
note over Web,Room
Connected clients show the committed state within 2 seconds.
end note
Teacher -> Web: Reopen ended target
Web -> Server: Teacher reopen command
Server -> Service: create new Round for same logical target
Service -> Repo: Transaction: create new Round(Waiting), set currentRound, increment version
Repo --> Service: committed snapshot
Server -> Room: Emit session:state:changed
Room --> Web: Notify connected clients of new Waiting Round
Teacher -> Web: Start reopened Round
Web -> Server: Teacher start command
Server -> Service: activate existing new Round
Service -> Repo: Transaction: Waiting -> Active, increment version
Server -> Room: Emit session:state:changed
Room --> Web: Notify connected clients of Active
Teacher -> Web: End reopened Round
Web -> Server: Teacher end command
Server -> Service: end current Round (winner supplied by owning Feature, if any)
Service -> Repo: Transaction: Active -> Ended; persist/replace Result if owner supplies winner
Repo --> Service: committed Ended snapshot and current Result (or no result)
Server -> Room: Emit session:state:changed with Ended snapshot
Room --> Web: Notify connected clients of Ended
Student -> Web: View result after Ended
Web -> Server: GET /api/v1/sessions/{sessionId}/results
Server --> Web: Existing results response contract
Student -> Web: Reconnect and watch Session
Web -> Server: session:watch {sessionId}
Server -> Service: Read authoritative current snapshot
Service -> Repo: Read Session + current Round + stateVersion
Repo --> Service: Latest snapshot
Server --> Web: session:state snapshot
note over Service,Repo
Foundation persists a winner supplied by the owning Feature;
it does not determine correctness, submission order or winner.
The Ended state and Result commit before the Ended broadcast.
State snapshots contain references only, never Question/Blank content.
end note
@enduml
